# math/native - Aiki exact/explicit-work math semantics

@func floor
@template "floor(x)"
@help "Returns the largest integer less than or equal to x."

@func ceil
@template "ceil(x)"
@help "Returns the smallest integer greater than or equal to x."

@func modulo
@template "modulo(a, b)"
@help "Returns the Euclidean remainder of a divided by b."

@func sin
@template "sin(x, terms)"
@help "Returns sine using a finite Taylor series; terms bounds work, not error."

@func cos
@template "cos(x, terms)"
@help "Returns cosine using a finite Taylor series; terms bounds work, not error."

@func sqrt
@template "sqrt(x, iterations)"
@help "Returns square-root approximation by Newton iteration; iterations bounds work, not error."
